# DSO101 Assignment 4 — Ritesh Adhikari (02250365)

## Deploy Your First Web App using GitHub & Render

### Tools Used
- GitHub
- GitHub Actions
- Render (Static Site)

### Steps Taken
1. Created a simple HTML/CSS static website
2. Pushed code to GitHub
3. Set up GitHub Actions workflow that triggers on every push to main
4. Deployed the site on Render as a Static Site

